        h3 §Atomically reference counted pointers @149,906,562,18
        text The type is the threadsafe equivalent of the type. It provides all the same functionality of , except it requires that the contained type is shareable. Additionally, is itself sendable while is not. @149,936,562,61
        link Arc sync/index.html @149,1009,562,21
