        link Rc<T> rc/index.html @149,1171,562,20
        text This type allows for shared access to the contained data, and is often paired with synchronization primitives such as mutexes to allow mutation of shared resources. @149,1203,562,41
        h3 §Collections @149,1256,562,18
        text Implementations of the most common general purpose data structures are defined in this library. They are re-exported through the . @149,1286,562,41
        link "standard collections library" ../std/collections/index.html @149,1339,562,20
        h3 §Heap interfaces @149,1371,562,19
        text The module defines the low-level interface to the default global allocator. It is not compatible with the libc allocator API. @149,1402,562,41
